WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.500
There's this one

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.085
map you have to see to understand

00:00:02.085 --> 00:00:03.712
the full effects of war. 

00:00:03.712 --> 00:00:04.087
Right now,

00:00:04.087 --> 00:00:05.839
there's a civil war happening in Sudan.

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:07.382
And like most conflicts,

00:00:07.382 --> 00:00:09.968
it comes down to two guys who want power.

00:00:09.968 --> 00:00:10.760
And in the process,

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:11.845
they're willing to disrupt

00:00:11.845 --> 00:00:13.722
the lives of millions of people.

00:00:13.722 --> 00:00:14.556
This map shows us

00:00:14.556 --> 00:00:15.265
how many people have

00:00:15.265 --> 00:00:16.307
had to flee their country

00:00:16.307 --> 00:00:17.434
because of this war.

00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:18.852
These people are leaving their homes

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:20.395
and fleeing to Sudan's

00:00:20.395 --> 00:00:22.480
neighbors like Chad and Egypt.

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:23.690
The reports say that over

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:25.775
5 million people have been displaced

00:00:25.775 --> 00:00:27.027
because of this conflict.

00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:27.819
If you want to understand

00:00:27.819 --> 00:00:28.820
the roots of this conflict,

00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:29.654
go check out the whole video

00:00:29.654 --> 00:00:30.488
we made on the channel.

00:00:30.488 --> 00:00:31.614
And if you want to better understand

00:00:31.614 --> 00:00:33.616
global politics, follow along for more.

